! EC-0016: attributes are carried by the program and change nothing about the run

@this script is a conformance case for attributes

variable Total @the running total

Main: @where the counting happens
	put 0 into Total
	while Total is less than 4 @show Total
	begin
		add 1 to Total
		log Total @show Total ! the comment is not part of the attribute
	end
	log `done @ last`
	log `a literal @ is not an attribute`
